+# Skill sc:sc-adversarial-protocol - Adversarial Debate & Merge Pipeline
+
+<!-- Extended metadata (for documentation, not parsed):
+category: analysis
+complexity: advanced
+mcp-servers: [context7, serena]
+personas: [architect, analyzer, scribe]
