+| Specifies out-of-scope items | MET/NOT MET | <evidence> | MET/NOT MET | <evidence> |
+| **Subtotal** | **<N>/5** | | **<N>/5** | |
+
+### Correctness (5 criteria)
+[Same table format as Completeness]
+
+### Structure (5 criteria)
+[Same table format as Completeness]
+
